        1228,
        1503,
        1350
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, on September 15, 2021, I issued Emergency Executive Order No. 241 and declared a state of emergency to exist within the correction facilities operated by the DOC, most recently extended by Emergency Executive Order No. 314, and such declaration remains in effect;",
